# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: L3afpad.
Package: L3afpad
Section: Text
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport, Iconv
Recommends: TTF-Noto-Color-Emoji
Components: Apps.Document.!L3afpad (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk
Description: L3afpad simple text editor (GTK 3)
 A lightweight text editor with a window per document, printing
 through !Printers, RISC OS Save and Open boxes and a Choices window.
 .
 This is a public beta of the riscos-gtk ports.
Build-Map: !L3afpad -> Apps/Document/!L3afpad
Build-Notice: L3afpad, packaged for PackMan from the riscos-gtk release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-gtk/releases
 .
 L3afpad is L3afpad 0.8.18.1.11 (github.com/stevenhoneyman/l3afpad), under the GNU GPL version 2 or later. It is linked with GTK 3 and its
 libraries (LGPL) and includes DejaVu fonts and PThreadTicker. The
 source is offered by the Source file in the application and on the
 release page. Licences follow.
